1
00:00:02,125 --> 00:00:03,000
Thanks for coming.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,250
Go grab a seat.

3
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:05,000
Wait!

4
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,500
Severin, have you lost your mind?!

5
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:15,916
This is the Holy
Cathedral, not a damn mine!

6
00:00:17,791 --> 00:00:18,791
They’re my friends.

7
00:00:19,916 --> 00:00:21,041
Got a problem with that?

8
00:00:22,375 --> 00:00:23,666
Hell yes I do!

9
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,416
My daughter married
into nobility,

10
00:00:27,291 --> 00:00:30,916
 not to some loser who
hangs with dirt-diggers!

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,750
There's nothing wrong with miners.

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,291
Their blood's just
as red as yours.

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Maybe.

14
00:00:40,875 --> 00:00:42,125
But they're not your equals.

15
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:45,625
The Scott family won't
be dirtied by scum.

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Either they leave,

17
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:48,625
or there's no wedding!

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,166
I told you
we never should have

19
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:54,125
let Livia marry this worthless fool.

20
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:57,041
Who knew the eldest
son of House Carter would

21
00:00:57,041 --> 00:00:59,416
turn out to be
such a complete failure.

22
00:01:00,041 --> 00:01:02,041
These men worked side by side with my son.

23
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,125
They mean well.

24
00:01:03,125 --> 00:01:04,125
Please, let it go.

25
00:01:04,541 --> 00:01:05,500
Absolutely not!

26
00:01:05,666 --> 00:01:08,000
If these filthy losers
don’t get out right now,

27
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,416
this wedding is canceled!

28
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:15,416
It’s cool, Severin.

29
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:16,875
We’ll head out.

30
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:19,125
We’re too dirty
for this place anyway.

31
00:01:19,541 --> 00:01:20,291
Congrats.

32
00:01:20,291 --> 00:01:21,500
Yeah, congrats, Severin.

33
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:22,250
We’ll take off.

34
00:01:23,916 --> 00:01:26,250
Ugh, little bug, move away.

35
00:01:27,291 --> 00:01:29,500
Trash. Go back where you belong.

36
00:01:29,875 --> 00:01:31,125
Finally,

37
00:01:31,250 --> 00:01:32,125
they're leaving.

38
00:01:33,125 --> 00:01:34,500
No one leaves today!
